  "title": "Vertiv Issues Recommendations for Data Center Operators to Withstand Global Heat Waves",
  "summary": "Record-breaking heat waves are making headlines and straining economies around the globe, with no signs of cooling down in the immediate future. Beyond the impact on human lives, extreme heat is taking a major toll on data center operations and infrastructure, from outages and disruptions at data centers in the United Kingdom to reduced production at power plants in France to concerns over water usage in drought-affected areas in the United States.",
